{
    "title": "Frontier City",
    "description": "A sudden zombie outbreak has engulfed the world, plunging modern civilization back into the dark ages almost overnight. All forms of government, military, and national order collapse beneath the zombie onslaught. Humanity crumbles and scatters into hiding across the earth.\r\n\r\nBut lose not all hope, for anarchy never lasts long. From war-torn refugees and tormented soldiers, new leaders awaken one after another, determined to reclaim our world. Slowly, they gather the people across forgotten cities and consolidate power to restore order to a land festering with zombies and cuthroats.\r\n\r\nToday, as a renowned hero in a newly risen force, you have been elected to lead the people and rebuild human civilization. Do you have what it takes, Commander?\r\n\r\nCountless helpless refugees wait for us to rescue them, using all that we have;\r\nOur city, with its neverending list of urgencies, awaits reconstruction;\r\nForgotten technologies await their rediscovery;\r\n\r\n[Rebuild The City]\r\nThe Apocalypse has come in full force. But enclosed within our fortresses, we cling still to hope. As long as an able leader musters the people to rebuild the ruins, we can surely return to modern urban living! \r\n\r\n[Withstand The  Zombies]\r\nThe zombie horror covers the earth. The once-prosperous farms and industries in the cities and countryside have fallen to ruin. We must war against these abominations. Can you lead us to seize back desperately needed supplies from out of the jaws of hell? \r\n\r\n[Prepare For War]\r\nAgainst an organized military, disorganized zombies pose little threat. But as zombies with higher-order traits evolve and more depraved marauders emerge, only a doctrine of force will ensure our survival in this forsaken land!\r\n\r\n[Build the Future] \r\nHumanity has faced extinction countless times. The zombie calamity isn't the first and won't be the last. If we continue standing shoulder to shoulder, hand in hand, we will surely see a new earth!",
    "descriptionHTML": "A sudden zombie outbreak has engulfed the world, plunging modern civilization back into the dark ages almost overnight. All forms of government, military, and national order collapse beneath the zombie onslaught. Humanity crumbles and scatters into hiding across the earth.<br><br>But lose not all hope, for anarchy never lasts long. From war-torn refugees and tormented soldiers, new leaders awaken one after another, determined to reclaim our world. Slowly, they gather the people across forgotten cities and consolidate power to restore order to a land festering with zombies and cuthroats.<br><br>Today, as a renowned hero in a newly risen force, you have been elected to lead the people and rebuild human civilization. Do you have what it takes, Commander?<br><br>Countless helpless refugees wait for us to rescue them, using all that we have;<br>Our city, with its neverending list of urgencies, awaits reconstruction;<br>Forgotten technologies await their rediscovery;<br><br>[Rebuild The City]<br>The Apocalypse has come in full force. But enclosed within our fortresses, we cling still to hope. As long as an able leader musters the people to rebuild the ruins, we can surely return to modern urban living! <br><br>[Withstand The  Zombies]<br>The zombie horror covers the earth. The once-prosperous farms and industries in the cities and countryside have fallen to ruin. We must war against these abominations. Can you lead us to seize back desperately needed supplies from out of the jaws of hell? <br><br>[Prepare For War]<br>Against an organized military, disorganized zombies pose little threat. But as zombies with higher-order traits evolve and more depraved marauders emerge, only a doctrine of force will ensure our survival in this forsaken land!<br><br>[Build the Future] <br>Humanity has faced extinction countless times. The zombie calamity isn&#39;t the first and won&#39;t be the last. If we continue standing shoulder to shoulder, hand in hand, we will surely see a new earth!",
